<%@ page contentType="text/html;charset=UTF-8" language="java" %>
<%@ page import="greenhouse.greenhouse.CsrfGuard,java.util.Map" %>
<%@ include file="/home/frame/login_check.jsp" %>
<% request.setAttribute("pageTitle", "报警个人驾驶舱"); Map<?,?> alarmUser=(Map<?,?>)session.getAttribute("loginUser"); String alarmRole=String.valueOf(alarmUser.get("roleId")); %>
<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>报警个人驾驶舱</title>
<%@ include file="/home/frame/frame_style.jsp" %>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="<%= request.getContextPath() %>/maintain/alarm/alarm.css"></head>
<body class="page-header-fixed page-quick-sidebar-over-content"><%@ include file="/home/frame/frame_header.jsp" %><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="page-container"><%@ include file="/home/frame/frame_left_sidebar.jsp" %><div class="page-content-wrapper"><div class="page-content"><%@ include file="/home/frame/frame_page_header.jsp" %>
<main id="alarm-app" data-base="<%= request.getContextPath() %>" data-role="<%= alarmRole %>" data-mode="dashboard"><input id="alarm-token" type="hidden" value="<%= CsrfGuard.token(session) %>">
<p class="alarm-links"><a class="btn btn-default" href="<%= request.getContextPath() %>/maintain/alarm/index.jsp">报警事件</a> <a class="btn btn-default" href="<%= request.getContextPath() %>/maintain/alarm/dashboard.jsp">报警驾驶舱</a></p><section class="portlet light bordered"><div class="portlet-body"><form id="alarm-query" class="alarm-filters">
<label>大棚<select class="form-control" name="greenhouseId"><option value="">全部大棚</option></select></label>
<label>监测指标<select class="form-control" name="metric"><option value="">全部指标</option><option value="air_temperature">空气温度</option><option value="air_humidity">空气湿度</option><option value="soil_temperature">土壤温度</option><option value="soil_moisture">土壤湿度</option><option value="illuminance">光照强度</option></select></label>
<label>来源<select class="form-control" name="source"><option value="">全部来源</option><option value="real">实采</option><option value="simulated">模拟</option><option value="manual">人工</option></select></label>
<label>事件状态<select class="form-control" name="state"><option value="">全部状态</option><option value="pending">待确认</option><option value="processing">处理中</option><option value="closed">已关闭</option></select></label>
<label>触发起日<input class="form-control" type="date" name="start"></label><label>触发止日<input class="form-control" type="date" name="end"></label>
<div class="alarm-query-buttons"><button class="btn blue" type="submit">查询</button><button class="btn btn-default" type="reset">重置</button></div></form>
<button id="alarm-options-retry" type="button" class="btn btn-default" hidden>重试加载大棚</button><button id="alarm-refresh" class="btn btn-default" type="button">立即刷新</button><p>默认最近7个自然日，含今天；每30秒刷新已应用条件。</p><p id="alarm-status" role="status">正在读取…</p><p id="alarm-updated"></p></div></section><section id="alarm-statistics" class="portlet light bordered"><div class="portlet-title"><div class="caption"><span class="caption-subject bold">报警事件统计</span></div></div><div class="portlet-body"><p id="alarm-scope"></p><div id="alarm-counts" class="alarm-counts"></div><p>按首次触发时间和来源统计；关闭率包含正常恢复与失效关闭，另列正常恢复数。数量单位为事件，不是样本次数。</p><div id="alarm-charts" class="alarm-charts"></div></div></section></main></div></div></div><%@ include file="/home/frame/frame_footer.jsp" %><%@ include file="/home/frame/frame_javascript.jsp" %><script src="<%= request.getContextPath() %>/maintain/alarm/alarm.js"></script></body></html>